			"notes": "IR Lights 1.1.5 for Minecraft 1.21.11 with the Flashback keyframe bridge.\n\nBuilt on the current upstream IR Lights 1.1.5 (irl-core 1.1.3) — carries the new editor features (free-fly camera, in-world guides + spotlight handles, inspector tabs, quality/beam presets, etc.) and every fix already merged upstream. This fork adds only the Flashback bridge. **irl-core is bundled inside this jar (JiJ)** — install just this one file, no separate core.\n\n**Install** (Fabric, with Fabric API + Iris + Sodium): put `irl-redactor-1.21.11-flashback-1.1.5.jar` in `mods/`, then **re-patch your shaderpack** via the in-editor Patcher (button in the light editor, key J).\n\nFor the Flashback timeline integration also install:\n* the **flashback-irl addon** for 1.21.11 — https://github.com/zqicev/flashback-addon-irl/releases (unchanged, IR-Lights-version-independent)\n* **Flashback** for 1.21.11 (Modrinth)"
		},
