			"notes": "IR Lights fixes build for Minecraft 1.21.8 (Axiom compatibility and the far-from-origin light fix).\n\nInstall (Fabric, with Fabric API). Put both jars in mods/:\n* irl-core-1.21.8-1.0-obt.jar\n* irl-redactor-1.21.8-1.0-obt.jar\n\nNote for 1.21.8: placed lights and solid-block shadows work as usual, but mob/player and cutout-block (e.g. leaves) shadows are disabled on this version. 1.21.8 has the 1.21.5 rendering pipeline but not the 1.21.9 render command queue that the geometry capture relies on, so that capture is turned off here."
